  "label": "Child Hunger",
  "description": "Child hunger refers to the condition where children do not receive adequate nutrition, leading to health and developmental problems. This is a global issue often addressed by NGOs and international aid organizations. The meme uses the visual of a child’s hand and the text 'feed these children' to evoke empathy and awareness of this specific humanitarian crisis.",
